++## Verification limits and open work
++
++Static incremental diff/read inspection, import/reference searches, canonical-byte hashing and git diff whitespace checking only. The hash calculation reproduced pre-unit r130 29613ca0ba37bdb581e35d20541dbb94b661306ce80317e6a0c68c7f4ef554bc and produced r131 b76090c94f3190e7737220658fa97f7815a684ffc4c299035bb20f0ba1cb4882. It is not the official version checker or semantic verification; raw CRLF checkout was not normalized. Official version validation, runtime/React integration and inline/split execution remain pending authorized Actions. No application/test/build/checker/Actions/TLC execution this unit. Prior r129 execution deviation is not reused as evidence.
